  "id": "cherry-and-blonde-chocolate-hot-cross-buns",
  "name": "Cherry and Blonde Chocolate Hot Cross Buns",
  "subtitle": "Soft spiced buns with cherries, ginger, and chocolate",
  "description": "Enriched yeast buns flavored with citrus and warm spices, filled with dried cherries, stem ginger, and blonde chocolate, then finished with traditional flour crosses.",
